{
    "id": "07",
    "title": "異常處理 (Exceptions)",
    "content": "<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.12) 0%, rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.04) 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.2); border-left: 4px solid #EF4444; padding: 32px; margin-bottom: 60px; border-radius: 4px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; top: -20px; right: -20px; opacity: 0.05; transform: rotate(15deg);\"><svg width=\"120\" height=\"120\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#EF4444\" stroke-width=\"1\"><path d=\"M10.29 3.86L1.82 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 0 0 1.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 0 0-3.42 0z\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"13\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"12.01\" y2=\"17\"/></svg></div><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-heading); font-weight: 300;\">Photon 實作了 **Fail-Safe 執行核心**。我們保證單個請求的崩潰永遠不會危及整個系統的穩定性或效能。</p></div><h2>隔離架構 (Isolation Architecture)</h2><p>Photon 的異常處理與主事件循環解耦。每個異常都被限制在特定作用域內，確保了原子化的狀態管理與記憶體安全性。</p><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; margin: 48px 0;\" class=\"bento-grid\"><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(239,64,64,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"> <div style=\"color: #EF4444; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">ERROR_TRAP</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">JIT 優化的 try-catch 邊界，能以近乎零的開銷捕獲執行期失敗，不影響成功請求的效能。</p></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(239,64,64,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"><div style=\"color: #EF4444; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 2l-2 2m-7.61 7.61a5.5 5.5 0 1 1-7.778 7.778 5.5 5.5 0 0 1 7.777-7.777zm0 0L15.5 7.5m0 0l3 3L22 7l-3-3-3.5 3.5z\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">ATOMIC_RESET</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">失敗的請求會立即觸發標頭清洗與上下文抹除，有效回滾至錯誤交付前的狀態。</p></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(239,64,64,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"><div style=\"color: #EF4444; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><line x1=\"22\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"12\"/><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"2\" y2=\"12\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"2\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"18\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">TYPED_ALARM</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">與自訂類別無縫整合。Photon 利用 instance-of 檢查實現高速的錯誤分類。</p></div></div><h2>全域編排 (Global Orchestration)</h2><p><code>onError</code> 矩陣允許您為失敗解析定義集中化的遺邏輯。無論是驗證不匹配還是資料庫超時，解析過程都是統一且高效的。</p><pre><code>app.onError((err, c) => {\n  const telemetryId = c.get('trace_id')\n  \n  if (err instanceof ValidationException) {\n    return c.json({ error: 'DATA_MISMATCH', fields: err.errors }, 422)\n  }\n  \n  return c.json({ \n    status: 'SYSTEM_ERROR', \n    ref: telemetryId \n  }, 500)\n})</code></pre><div style=\"background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.1); border-left: 4px solid #EF4444; padding: 24px; margin: 40px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900; color: #EF4444; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;\">// 系統日誌：復原機制 (RECOVERY_DYNAMICS)</h4><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; font-style: italic; color: var(--text-heading); opacity: 0.9; border: none; padding: 0;\">Photon 會自動處理未捕獲的 Rejections。即使第三方 Promise 在您的處理器中失敗，**Global Guard** 也會防止 Bun 處理程序異常結束。</p></div><h2>傳播延遲分析</h2><p>異常傳播期間的響應延遲。Photon 確保錯誤交付的速度幾乎與標準響應一樣快。</p><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; margin: 40px 0; border-radius: 4px;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 30px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #EF4444; margin-bottom: 12px; font-family: var(--font-technical);\"><span>PHOTON_INTERNAL_EXCEPTION_PATH</span> <span>< 0.005ms</span></div><div style=\"height: 8px; background: rgba(239,68,68,0.1); width: 100%; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"height: 100%; width: 5%; background: #EF4444; box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(239,68,68,0.5);\"></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 30px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #6B7280; margin-bottom: 12px; font-family: var(--font-technical);\"><span>標準錯誤物件建構開銷</span> <span>0.15ms</span></div><div style=\"height: 8px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); width: 100%; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"height: 100%; width: 80%; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\"></div></div></div><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; font-family: var(--font-technical); border: none; padding: 0;\">// 指標：即使在極端負載下也能維持高速分發</p></div><h2>自訂異常邏輯</h2><p>擴展基礎 <code>Error</code> 類別以建立具備豐富上下文的異常，並在管道中攜帶額外的元資料。</p><pre><code>class BusinessError extends Error {\n  constructor(public code: string, message: string) {\n    super(message)\n    this.name = 'BusinessError'\n  }\n}\n\n// 在處理器中觸發\napp.post('/api/pay', async (c) => {\n  if (balance < amount) {\n    throw new BusinessError('LOW_FUNDS', '餘額不足')\n  }\n})</code></pre><div style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1), transparent); border-left: 4px solid #3B82F6; padding: 24px; margin-top: 60px; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; font-style: italic; border: none; padding: 0; color: var(--text-heading);\">**專業提示：** 將 `notFound` 處理器專門用於 SPA 的後撤機制 (Fallbacks)。如果客戶端請求 `text/html`，則返回您的 index.html；否則，返回原子化的 404 JSON。</p></div>",
